---
import ToolLayout from '../components/ToolLayout.astro';
---

<ToolLayout
	title="About Starmore Tools"
	description="Learn about Starmore Tools, a free digital tools platform and a branch of Starmore Media and Consultancy Limited."
>
	<article class="about-page">
		<header class="about-hero">
			<a class="back-link" href="/">← Home</a>
			<p class="eyebrow"><span class="about-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span> ABOUT STARMORE TOOLS</p>
			<h1>Starmore Tools</h1>
			<p class="about-tagline">Everything you need. <span>Free to use.</span></p>
			<div class="about-introduction">
				<p>
					Starmore Tools is a digital tools platform and a branch of <a class="company-link" href="https://starmoremedia.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Starmore Media and Consultancy Limited</strong></a>,
					created with one clear mission: to make useful digital tools accessible to everyone, everywhere, without unnecessary financial barriers.
				</p>
				<p>
					We believe that access to technology should not be limited by someone's income, location or professional background.
					Whether you're a student, business owner, designer, developer, creator, professional or simply someone trying to get something done,
					you should have access to the tools that make your work easier.
				</p>
				<p>
					That's why we're building Starmore Tools: one platform where people can find and use free tools for almost anything they need.
				</p>
				<p>
					From image editing, logo creation, document processing and calculations to business utilities, writing, design, development,
					social media, file conversion and everyday tasks, our goal is to bring useful digital solutions together in one place.
				</p>
				<p>We want to keep expanding, improving and introducing new tools as people's needs change.</p>
			</div>
		</header>

		<section class="about-section" aria-label="Our mission and vision">
			<article class="about-card">
				<p class="eyebrow">01 / OUR MISSION</p>
				<h2>Our Mission</h2>
				<p>
					To make digital tools freely accessible to everyone, giving individuals and businesses the ability to create,
					solve problems, work smarter and achieve more without having to pay for every little task.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="about-card">
				<p class="eyebrow">02 / OUR VISION</p>
				<h2>Our Vision</h2>
				<p>
					To become a trusted global destination for free digital tools, bringing together practical solutions for
					virtually every digital need under one platform.
				</p>
			</article>
		</section>

		<section class="about-values">
			<div class="about-section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">03 / OUR PRINCIPLES</p>
				<h2>What We Stand For</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="values-grid">
				<article class="value-card">
					<span>01</span>
					<h3>Accessibility</h3>
					<p>Useful tools should be available to everyone.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="value-card">
					<span>02</span>
					<h3>Freedom</h3>
					<p>People should be able to accomplish everyday tasks without unnecessary subscriptions or payments.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="value-card">
					<span>03</span>
					<h3>Simplicity</h3>
					<p>Technology should be easy to understand and use.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="value-card">
					<span>04</span>
					<h3>Innovation</h3>
					<p>We continuously explore better ways to solve everyday problems.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="value-card">
					<span>05</span>
					<h3>Inclusivity</h3>
					<p>Our tools are built for individuals, businesses, students and professionals everywhere.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-founder">
			<div class="about-section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">04 / THE PEOPLE BEHIND IT</p>
				<h2>Who Is Behind Starmore Tools?</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="founder-copy">
				<p>
					Starmore Tools is an initiative of <a class="company-link" href="https://starmoremedia.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Starmore Media and Consultancy Limited</a>, founded by
					<strong>Stephen Tatasumbu</strong>, the company's Chief Executive Officer and Founder.
				</p>
				<p>
					With a background spanning creative media, digital technology, branding, design and business development,
					he founded Starmore with an interest in building practical digital solutions that make a difference.
				</p>
				<p>
					His vision for Starmore Tools is to build a platform where people don't have to visit dozens of websites,
					pay for multiple subscriptions or struggle to find simple solutions to everyday problems.
				</p>
				<p>
					The ambition is straightforward: bring as many useful tools as possible into one accessible platform and make them free for everyone.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-promise">
			<p class="eyebrow">05 / OUR PROMISE</p>
			<h2>Our Promise</h2>
			<p>
				Starmore Tools is built around the idea that useful technology should be accessible, not unnecessarily expensive.
				Our goal is to keep our tools free to use, continually expand our collection and make the platform useful to people around the world.
			</p>
			<p class="about-signoff"><strong>Starmore Tools</strong> — Everything you need. Free to use.</p>
		</section>

		<footer class="about-contact">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK</p>
				<h2>Contact</h2>
				<p><strong>Starmore Tools</strong><br />A branch of <a class="company-link" href="https://starmoremedia.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Starmore Media and Consultancy Limited</a>.</p>
			</div>
			<a class="whatsapp-button" href="https://wa.me/2348178136167" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Contact Starmore Tools on WhatsApp">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="M20.5 11.7a8.3 8.3 0 0 1-12.3 7.2L3.5 20l1.2-4.5a8.3 8.3 0 1 1 15.8-3.8Z"></path>
					<path d="M9 8.2c.2-.4.4-.4.7-.4h.4c.2 0 .4 0 .5.4l.7 1.7c.1.3.1.5-.1.7l-.5.6c-.2.2-.3.4-.1.7.5.9 1.2 1.6 2.1 2.1.3.2.5.1.7-.1l.7-.8c.2-.2.4-.3.7-.2l1.6.8c.3.1.4.3.4.5s-.1 1-.7 1.5c-.6.5-1.3.7-2.1.5-1.3-.3-2.7-1-4-2.3-1.1-1.1-1.9-2.5-2.2-3.7-.3-.9 0-1.6.5-2.1.2-.2.5-.3.7-.3Z"></path>
				</svg>
				<span><small>WHATSAPP</small>Message us on WhatsApp</span>
				<span class="whatsapp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
			</a>
		</footer>
	</article>
</ToolLayout>

<style>
	.about-page { max-width: 930px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 25px 74px; }
	.about-hero { padding-bottom: 38px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d7e3e6; }
	.back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #087f8c; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; }
	.about-page .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #087f8c; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .13em; }
	.about-pulse { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-right: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #20b6c3; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #20b6c31c; }
	.about-hero h1 { margin: 0; font-family: Manrope, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 68px); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: 1; }
	.about-tagline { margin: 12px 0 24px; color: #596c74; font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 25px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
	.about-tagline span { color: #07899a; }
	.about-introduction, .founder-copy { max-width: 760px; }
	.about-introduction p, .founder-copy p, .about-card > p:last-child, .value-card p, .about-promise > p:not(.eyebrow, .about-signoff), .about-contact > div > p:last-child { color: #52666e; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; }
	.about-introduction p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
	.about-introduction p:last-child, .founder-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.about-introduction strong, .founder-copy strong { color: #1d343c; }
	.company-link { color: #087f8c; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #07899a55; text-underline-offset: 3px; transition: color .2s, text-decoration-color .2s; }
	.company-link:hover { color: #055f69; text-decoration-color: currentColor; }
	.about-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; padding: 28px 0; }
	.about-card, .value-card { border: 1px solid #d2e0e3; border-radius: 9px; background: #f8fbfc; }
	.about-card { padding: 20px; }
	.about-card h2, .about-section-heading h2, .about-contact h2 { margin: 0; color: #142129; font-family: Manrope, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
	.about-card > p:last-child { margin: 12px 0 0; }
	.about-values { padding: 10px 0 30px; }
	.about-section-heading { margin-bottom: 15px; }
	.values-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
	.value-card { min-height: 128px; padding: 15px; transition: border-color .2s, box-shadow .2s, transform .2s; }
	.value-card:hover { border-color: #36afba; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #087e8c12; transform: translateY(-2px); }
	.value-card > span { color: #07899a; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; }
	.value-card h3 { margin: 12px 0 5px; color: #1d343c; font-family: Manrope, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; }
	.value-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.65; }
	.about-founder { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, .75fr) 1.25fr; gap: 30px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #d7e3e6; }
	.about-founder .about-section-heading { margin: 0; }
	.about-founder .about-section-heading h2 { max-width: 300px; }
	.founder-copy p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
	.about-promise { margin-top: 12px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #b9dfe2; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf5f6, #f8fbfc 70%); }
	.about-promise h2 { max-width: 520px; color: #142129; font-family: Manrope, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
	.about-promise > p:not(.eyebrow, .about-signoff) { max-width: 700px; margin: 12px 0 0; }
	.about-signoff { margin: 18px 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #cce2e5; color: #087f8c; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; }
	.about-contact { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; margin-top: 18px; padding: 22px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #d7e3e6; }
	.about-contact h2 { font-size: 21px; }
	.about-contact > div > p:last-child { margin: 7px 0 0; font-size: 11px; }
	.about-contact > div > p:last-child strong { color: #1d343c; }
	.whatsapp-button { display: inline-flex; min-height: 54px; align-items: center; gap: 11px; padding: 9px 14px; border: 1px solid #07899a; border-radius: 7px; background: #07899a; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s, transform .2s; }
	.whatsapp-button:hover { background: #066f7c; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px #07899a35; transform: translateY(-2px); }
	.whatsapp-button svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
	.whatsapp-button span:nth-child(2) { display: grid; gap: 3px; }
	.whatsapp-button small { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .12em; opacity: .8; }
	.whatsapp-arrow { margin-left: 9px; font-size: 15px; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-hero { border-color: #20252b; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-page .eyebrow,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-tagline span,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .value-card > span,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-signoff { color: #42d4e5; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-tagline,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-introduction p,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .founder-copy p,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-card > p:last-child,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .value-card p,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-promise > p:not(.eyebrow, .about-signoff),
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-contact > div > p:last-child { color: #a0a8b0; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-introduction strong,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .founder-copy strong,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-contact > div > p:last-child strong { color: #e8edf0; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .company-link { color: #42d4e5; text-decoration-color: #42d4e555; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .company-link:hover { color: #8cebf3; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-card,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .value-card { border-color: #242c32; background: #0e1216; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-card h2,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-section-heading h2,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-promise h2,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-contact h2,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .value-card h3 { color: #e8edf0; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-founder,
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-contact { border-color: #20252b; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-promise { border-color: #28525a; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #102328, #0b0e11 75%); }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .about-signoff { border-color: #26363a; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .whatsapp-button { border-color: #28b9c5; background: #1495a2; color: #061012; }
	:global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .whatsapp-button:hover { background: #42d4e5; }
	@media (max-width: 680px) {
		.about-page { padding: 36px 4px 55px; }
		.about-hero { padding-bottom: 27px; }
		.about-section, .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.about-founder { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
		.value-card { min-height: auto; }
		.about-contact { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
	}
</style>
